{'symbol': 'PODD', 'date': '2023-05-04 16:15:00', 'title': 'INSULET ANNOUNCES NEW ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE TO DRIVE FURTHER GROWTH', 'text': 'ACTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INSULET CORPORATION (NASDAQ: PODD) (INSULET OR THE COMPANY), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN TUBELESS INSULIN PUMP TECHNOLOGY WITH ITS OMNIPOD® BRAND OF PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS NEW ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE DESIGNED TO ACCELERATE INNOVATION AND COMMERCIALIZATION. THE NEW STRUCTURE WILL BE IMPLEMENTED DURING THE SECOND HALF OF THIS YEAR WITH NEW LEADERSHIP ROLES EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2023. THE LEADERSHIP TEAM WILL CONTINUE TO REPORT TO JIM HOLLINGSHEAD, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF E.'}